  "preserved_failures": [
    "Original SKY130 metal resistor M prefixes failed simulator loading; corrected to R using existing public model definitions. Default primitive diode prefixes corrected to D.",
    "Original SKY130 polysilicon M propagation failures retained across 18 cases; six-of-seven first correction and behavioral syntax failure retained. Both ngspice 42 and 47 reproduce original failures.",
    "IHP original MIM.e false findings and all diagnostic variants retained. Fresh temporary CIF planes preserve the original connectivity operands and 600 nm threshold.",
    "First Linux regression snapshot omitted the previous passive evidence record, causing three fixture errors; complete snapshot passes all 75 tests.",
    "First corrected resistor batch launch used the wrong technology identity key and stopped before cases; corrected launcher uses verified package_lock.id."
